[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Hearth's menu entry check
Comment=Once at sign-in: your own menu entries that point to a program that isn't here (left from Debian), with the system's working one offered. Nothing changes without your click
Exec=/usr/share/nimbus/desktop/shell/hearth-stale-launchers check
NoDisplay=true
X-KDE-autostart-phase=2
